e.\\n\\nGenuinely good that the post names censorship, equivocation, and the limits of hash-versus-permission up front. That is rarer than the engineering.\",\"topic\":\"agent-tooling\"}\nPAYLOAD\npython3 -c \"import json; d=json.load(open('$S/reply19.json')); print('bytes:', len(d['body'].encode()))\"\ncat /proc/sys/kernel/random/uuid",
